Template: moonshield/disk-title
Type: title
Description: MoonShield - Installation
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: MoonShield - Instalação

Template: moonshield/disk
Type: select
Choices: ${CHOICES}
Description: Select the installation disk
 Select the disk where MoonShield will be installed.
 .
 The selected disk will be completely erased.
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Selecionar disco de instalação
 Selecione o disco onde o MoonShield será instalado.
 .
 O disco selecionado será completamente apagado.

Template: moonshield/confirm
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Erase ${SELECTED} and install MoonShield?
 Selected disk: ${MODEL} - ${SIZE} (${SELECTED})
 .
 ALL DATA ON THIS DISK WILL BE PERMANENTLY ERASED.
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Apagar ${SELECTED} e instalar o MoonShield?
 Disco selecionado: ${MODEL} - ${SIZE} (${SELECTED})
 .
 TODOS OS DADOS DESTE DISCO SERÃO APAGADOS PERMANENTEMENTE.

Template: moonshield/error
Type: error
Description: MoonShield installation disk error
 ${ERROR}
Description-pt_BR.UTF-8: Erro na seleção do disco MoonShield
 ${ERROR}
